Subject: [PATCH v3 RESEND 4/5] ARM: dts: enable SMP support for bcm28155
Date: Thu, 15 May 2014 12:58:10 -0500
Message-Id: <1400176691-26058-5-git-send-email-elder@linaro.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.9.1
